Sun Oct 11 12:00:00 UTC 2026 - tokajer <tokajer@tokajer.at>

- Gaming page: USB polling rate per controller, mouse or keyboard
  (kernel-nazoos patch 0022, usbcore.interrupt_interval_override);
  written to the kernel command line and to sysfs at once
- Apps: Waydroid, only installable while kernel-nazoos runs (Binder);
